Package: tidycleanr
Type: Package
Title: Streamlining Data Cleaning for Everyday Analysis
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Christine", "Jacob",
      email = "christinejacob@usf.edu",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Simple, consistent utilities for preparing messy tabular data. tidycleanr provides simple, reliable tools for preparing data frames for analysis. 
             The package currently includes functions for cleaning and standardizing column names, as well as removing duplicate rows while tracking how many duplicates were dropped. 
             These tools streamline the early stages of data cleaning, making it easier to prepare datasets efficiently and consistently.
